# `mismatch`: a template call's attribute fills the callee's parameter of its name, so an
# attribute no parameter has is an error. `Broken` passes `body=`, which `Quote` does not
# name; `Fine` passes `text=`, and checks clean.
Quote: fn Text -> Text
fn Quote text = "> {text}"

Broken: fn Text -> Text
fn Broken t = inline_text <txt>
<@Quote body=<<t>>/>
</txt>

Fine: fn Text -> Text
fn Fine t = inline_text <txt>
<@Quote text=<<t>>/>
</txt>
